<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-21032] ReadOnlyDynamicMBean.getAttributes may return a list of attribute values instead of Attribute instances</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-21032</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When supplying JMX information, the AttributeList class should contain Attributes, however the existing code returns attribute values. This can cause ClassCastExceptions in code that attempts to read an AttributeList.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/issues/11045&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;GitHub Issue #11045&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
